BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20110201T000000Z
DTEND:20110201T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:8iiqko05n0vm3ftdk80c4f0pgc@google.com
CREATED:20101218T205221Z
DESCRIPTION:$free\nhttp://hacklab.to/archives/monday-workshops-at-hacklab/\
 n\nThere will be a wearables / cyborg workshop at hacklab.to on Monday Janu
 ary 31st\, 7pm.  I'll be demoing my North Paw (compass anklet) and Heart Sp
 ark (pendant that flashes in time with my heart beat) projects\, plus I'll 
 have a variety of other things on hand\, including bliplace (sound reactive
  pendant)\, Truth Kit (galvanic skin response 'lie detector' wrist band)\, 
 Fabrick.it (a collection of wearable electronic modules)\, and of course so
 me lilypad stuff.  After the demo is over we'll have a discussion and works
 hop / show & tell time\, bring your own projects and get help and feedback!
   Beginners and non-hacklab members welcome\, stay as little or as long as 
 you like. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083836Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab: Wearables / Cyborg Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
