CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20150114T021903Z
DESCRIPTION:The Repair Café is a monthly gathering\, were they will have vo
 lunteer fixers available for computers\, electronics\, small appliances\, c
 lothes\, books\, among others. For whatever you need fixing\, bring it on! 
 You can learn how to fix it while enjoying a cup of coffee or tea. Or see w
 hat’s possible with the 3D printer or laser cutter on site. To avoid lineup
 s\, please arrive early. It would be best to arrive before 3 p.m. so that t
 here is enough time for the fixer to examine your item.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150214T223116Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, #12 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Repair Café Toronto
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
