BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20211021T230000Z
DTEND:20211022T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:dlbpohum0t7emn13lm6pu4me10@google.com
CREATED:20211020T164650Z
DESCRIPTION:<body>Revident Does A Thing - MQTT Exploration\n<div><br>\nI'm 
 revident\, a member of Hacklab Toronto\, and I want to do a Thing. \nThis e
 vening's thing is to explore the MQTT message bus that is part of \nthe aut
 omation of Hacklab's physical space.<br>\nI want to examine writing message
  to the MQTT bus\, and reading them \nback. Stretch goal is getting an ESP3
 2 based button to trigger some \naction by putting a message on the bus. </
 div>\n</body>
LAST-MODIFIED:20211022T001615Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:RDAT Night - MQTT Exploration
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
