CREATED:20190923T171058Z
DESCRIPTION:This is an introductory workshop to setting up your own small-s
 cale solar power system... from tiny panels that charge your phone\, to sys
 tems with a handful of batteries/panels that are suited to occasional off-g
 rid use. I'll be sharing from my own tests and experiences (from camping to
  solar robots)\, and I also welcome others to join who can share their proj
 ects and insights too. I'll bring some equipment as well (panels/batteries 
 etc) to give you a feel for what these items look like and try hooking thin
 gs up.
LAST-MODIFIED:20191023T222050Z
LOCATION:1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto\, ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Workshop - Intro to Small Scale Solar
TRANSP:OPAQUE
