DESCRIPTION:As some of you know\, hacklab member Alaina just spent the summ
 er at Singularity University\, in their 10 week summer program:\n\nhttp://s
 ingularityu.org/programs/graduate-studies-program/\n\nI have *tons* of ques
 tions for her about her experience\, and I'm sure you do too!  Rather than 
 have everyone keep asking her the same questions individually\, I figured i
 t would be good for us to have a gathering of interested people.  Alaina ha
 s agreed to be here at hacklab Thursday night to answer our questions\, 7pm
 -9pm.  Come and welcome her back!
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084047Z
