DESCRIPTION:Announcing Hacklab Free Day 2012!  Bring all your old electroni
 cs to hacklab on Jan 21st\, between 1pm and 5pm\, and then pick over all th
 e stuff that other people have brought!  Take home anything that you like. 
  This might be your chance to own that ancient _____ you've always coveted!
   At 5pm\, Shift Recycling will be coming by with a truck to take everythin
 g that isn't already claimed\, for e-cycling.\n\nNote: please do NOT bring 
 old CRT screens or empty ink/toner cartridges\, hacklab is too small and cl
 ean for those to be welcome.  Otherwise\, the crazier the thing\, the more 
 welcome it will be.  There will be a prize for the awesomest piece of histo
 ry :-)\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083711Z
LOCATION:170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Free Day
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
