DESCRIPTION:Hacklab Members Welcome!  I've limited the meetup RSVPs to 20\,
  so hopefully with the requisite 50% no show\, there will still be plenty o
 f room for members. Hope to see some of you there!<br><br> <a href="https:/
 /www.meetup.com/toronto-solarpunk-meetup/events/296817195/?isFirstPublish=t
 rue">https://www.meetup.com/toronto-solarpunk-meetup/events/296817195/</a><
 br> <br>First Meetup! While I don't have an official agenda for this meetin
 g\, here's some wonderful things that could happen:<br>- meet other Toronto
 /GTA solarpunks!<br>- get a tour of Hacklab.TO\, Toronto's first hackerspac
 e (since 2008)\, including electronics lab\, sewing area\, shop\, kitchen\,
  etc.<br>- talk about solarpunk - how to live as if the future is now\, gar
 dening\, technology\, sustainability\, decolonial enthusiasm\, nature\, cha
 nge\, etc...<br>- share resources - recommend to each other various things 
 we have found: websites\, board/video/TTRPG games\, favorite solarpunk plac
 es in the city\, whatever you got! Please bring show &amp\; tell if you hav
 e something physical!<br>- brainstorm future projects\, meetup event ideas\
 , destinations and venues\, new prospective people to invite to the group<b
 r>- your idea here!<br>- come away energized by helping make solarpunk idea
 ls more real in your life and in this city!
LAST-MODIFIED:20231018T181250Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto\, ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Toronto Solarpunk Meetup
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
