CREATED:20171106T215113Z
DESCRIPTION:Hey Hacklab - TL\;DR: by popular request\, I'll be giving a tal
 k at hacklab about my recent experiences in China\, Sat Nov 18th\, 2pm-4pm.
 \n\nI was in China from Oct 6th to the 28th\, 2017\, touring with Mitch Alt
 man's "Hacker Trip to China" (HTTC)\, a group of 20+ geeks interested in ha
 rdware and making in China.\n\nhttps://www.noisebridge.net/wiki/Noisebridge
 ChinaTrip7\n\nSome of the highlights from the tour:\n\n - 9 different hacke
 rspaces across 4 cites\n - high-speed train trips\, for a total of over 300
 0km\, plus rant about Chinese infrastructure prowess ("one belt one road" -
  arguably the most important geopolitical thing happening in the world righ
 t now)\n - Huaqiangbei electronics markets in Shenzhen\n - factory tours in
  Shenzhen and Shanghai\; including a visit to Seeed Studio (fascinating for
  anyone like me who has used their products and/or services)\n - personal s
 ide trips to MBA programs and a biohackerspace in Hangzhou\n - observation 
 on chinese culture\; plus differences I observed between this visit and my 
 previous ones in 2005\, 2008\, and 2009. For those interested this can also
  include a brief overview of gender issues in tech-china\, the rise of engl
 ish there\, as well as the advanced digitalization that's going on there ("
 it's the fucking future")\n - my thoughts about Chinese leadership in the 2
 1st century\, especially relevant with the recent 19th CPC National Congres
 s\, which occurred while I was there.\n - collected thoughts about being a 
 Digital Nomad\, from people I met who have been doing it for years\n\nI pro
 bably won't have to time to get to all of those\, let alone all the non-hig
 hlights from the trip (awesome food! long conversations with locals! amazin
 g buildings! crazy urban decay art! the great wall toboggan!  etc...) \, so
  basically my plan is in the first hour to pick my favorite 2 or 3 of those
 \, let the audience pick 2 or 3 more\, and then just default down to Q & A 
 for the 2nd hour.\n\nHope to see you all there.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20171106T215113Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Eric's China Experiences Talk
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
