DESCRIPTION:Hey hacklabbers!  I've been talking with Ryan Dyment of the Tor
 onto Tool Library:\n\nhttp://torontotoollibrary.com/\n1499 Queen Street Wes
 t in Parkdale\n\nI'll be going for a tour on Saturday May 4th\, at 1pm (thi
 s is next Saturday\, not this Saturday).  If you'd like to join me that wou
 ld be super awesome.  It'll be during their open hours (10am to 3pm) so exa
 ct timing not critical.  I think it's a super cool idea\, kind of like a co
 mbination of a library and a tech shop.  He came by the lab last night and 
 talked about an opportunity he has in east toronto (Danforth and Coxwell) t
 o set up something even closer to a techshop\, I feel like Toronto could re
 ally use that!\n\nAnyway\, if you're interested you can just show up\, or s
 end me an email and we can go together.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084659Z
LOCATION:1499 Queen Street West\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:tour Toronto Tool Library
TRANSP:OPAQUE
