DESCRIPTION:For hacklab members only.  Attendance will be capped at 4 due t
 o crowding in the lavoratory :-).  RSVP link to follow.\n\nCome learn how t
 o use the laser cutter.  We'll be using Inkscape to draw shapes\, an Inksca
 pe plugin to generate gcode\, and of course EMC2 to do the laser cutting.  
 By the end of the workshop you'll be able to operate the laser cutter by yo
