UID:5oelbu03kmcnkb73otkbefmock@google.com
CREATED:20170501T143627Z
DESCRIPTION:Venus Labs is a group of people who are passionate about space 
 - exploration\, discovery\, and our development as a spacefaring society. S
 pace is not a zero sum game where we must choose one target to focus all of
  our energies on - we love the moon\, Mars\, the asteroids\, and we love Ve
 nus. Our mission at Venus Labs is to raise awareness of Earth's sister plan
 et - the great unknowns that warrant investigation\, its surprisingly Earth
 like cloudtops\, and its great potential for our future.\nDoes that sound l
 ike YOU? Venus Labs is looking for more team members\, volunteers\, sponsor
 s\, well-wishers\, etc. Come out to our Venus Labs Toronto Kickoff Meetup a
 nd get involved! We're especially looking for scientists and engineers\, co
 mmunications professionals\, and artists\, but everyone is welcome\; now is
  a great time to make a huge impact on our small organization!\nAgenda of t
 he meetup: introductions all round. 10-minute talk by Eric on the purpose o
 f Venus Labs\; 10 more minutes laying our our 100-year plan. Group discussi
 on on what's needed\, what people are passionate about\, etc. Assignment of
  tasks\, titles\, etc: onboarding. \n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/venus-la
 bs-toronto-kickoff-meetup-tickets-6827817185\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170501T143627Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Venus Labs Kickoff Meeting
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
