UID:6ce5be2506a381a799a202cfdd54c15427ba78b5
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20180806T234044Z
DESCRIPTION:Every last Saturday of the month\, from around 3 pm until whene
 ver people leave\, the lab opens up our front door to members of the public
 . We’re specifically excited about folks who want to show off projects they
  have made or are working on\, want to ask for help with making something a
 wesome\, or want to help out on other folks’ projects. Bringing a laptop al
 ong to just chill out with other geeks is also welcome.\n\nThere’s no minim
 um skill level required to participate\, and we do our best to be a respect
 ful\, friendly environment for everyone. Regretfully we are not wheelchair 
 accessible – there are steps leading up to the floor the lab is on. As a he
 ads-up to folks with sensory processing issues\, the Tuesdays can get quite
  busy and noisy. 3-5pm tends to be the busiest time\, but in our new larger
  space there are usually places you can get away from it.\n\nMembers of the
  media are also welcome\, but in the interest of member privacy\, we have c
 ute little press passes hanging by the door and require that permission is 
 sought before taking photos with people in them.
LAST-MODIFIED:20190310T192101Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HackLab.TO (Saturday) Open House
TRANSP:OPAQUE
