DESCRIPTION:Hey guys!  \n\nI need your help.  In order to comply with Healt
 h Canada and FDA standards\, we're trying to figure out a way to prevent ou
 r 3D printable files from being sabotaged or pirated (and potentially killi
 ng billions of people if we ever needed to do a device recall).  Feel free 
 to invite your other DRM and cybersecurity genius buddies because I am comp
 letely clueless!  \n\nCheers\, JLW
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084447Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Discussion re: DRM and cybersecurity of 3D printable files
TRANSP:OPAQUE
