DESCRIPTION:Come one\, come all!  Hacklab will be celebrating it's 5th birt
 hday!  We've had five great years of tech community in Kensington Market\, 
 here's to having at least 5 more!\n\nWhat: Hacklab's 5th Birthday Party\nWh
 en: Saturday July 27th\, 8pm till late\nWhere: Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin St
 reet\, Toronto\, Canada\n\nBYOB.  Also\, Project Show & Tell!  Got a cool p
 roject you've been working on?  We'll have a show & tell session starting a
 t 10pm where you can show off what you've been up to\, and see what others 
 are doing.\n\nAll are welcome to attend\, you do not have to be a member of
  hacklab to be welcome at our birthday party.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084625Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.TO\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab 5th Birthday Party!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
