DESCRIPTION:$free\, RSVP at:\nhttp://www.meetup.com/Processing-js-Toronto/\
 n\nThis is a group for hacking on processing-js. The goals of this group is
  to showcase existing work\, help people convert their native processing wo
 rk into JavaScript\, teach people how to use processing-js\, and help out t
 he community by developing processing-js enhanced tools. \n\nI wanted to ge
 t everyone together in order to: - give a brief overview of processing-js -
  show some cool demos - allow group members to share their work - discuss c
 ool projects that we can do in order to benefit the community If you have a
 ny ideas fell free to put them on the agenda.
