CREATED:20160220T005909Z
DESCRIPTION:Starting tomorrow I'll be offline and without cellphone access 
 for 30 days during my simulated asteroid mission.\n\nI am permitted one per
 sonal phone chat once a week.  Do you think it might be possible to chat wi
 th hacklabers from NASA during a Tuesday night Open House on Feb. 23 from 2
 010 - 2040 EST (1910 – 1940 Central Time)?\n\nThis is how it works.  You ha
 ve to call a U.S. number so it might be a good idea to use a Chinatown call
 ing card.  I can't call you\, unfortunately.\n1.Dial 281-244-0114.  \n2.Wai
 t for the prompt\, “Please enter your authorization code”\n3.Wait for the b
 eep.\n4.Enter the code 2051 followed by #.  \n\nIf you're interested\, plea
 se let me know so I can reserve this time slot for hacklab.  If you want to
  post this event on the calendar\, website and social media\, it should be 
 fine.\n  \nCheers\,\n\n\nJulielynn Wong\, MD\, MPH\nDirector\, 3D4MD\nWebsi
 te:  www.3d4md.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20160224T002659Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Call with Julielynn from Asteroid Mission
