CREATED:20091230T223233Z
DESCRIPTION:Sharp knives are a marvellous thing\, and much safer to use tha
 n blunt and ill-maintained tools. Come hang out and learn how to put an edg
 e on your pocket knife\, maintain that leatherman blade\, and possibly make
  your terrible kitchen knives useful again.\n\nThere will be advice on what
  sort of sharpening stones you need to do this\, and sharpening stones avai
 lable to work with. Bring your big-ass kitchen knife. Or your mom's.\n\n** 
 Straight edge knives are preferable to scalloped or serrated\, because they
  are way easier to maintain.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084238Z
