DTSTART:20180627T230000Z
DTEND:20180628T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:64273gegd6ick8s3e62r9cudc1@google.com
CREATED:20180514T205722Z
DESCRIPTION:<a href="https://www.google.com/url?q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.faceboo
 k.com%2Fevents%2F2138583003043262%2F2139057782995784%2F&amp\;sa=D&amp\;usd=
 2&amp\;usg=AFQjCNEv3yDo4yz-pWe2_Kgy0i4hssbHHw" target="_blank">https://www.
 facebook.com/events/2138583003043262/</a><br><br>Christian Saucier\, the "C
 ryptoTech.guru"\, will present "Towards an Extropic Future: Blockchains and
  Social Scalability"<br><br>What’s the big deal with blockchains? Why have 
 they become so popular all of a sudden? The secret lies in what Nick Szabo 
 calls Social Scalability (<a href="https://unenumerated.blogspot.ca/2017/02
 /money-blockchains-and-social-scalability.html" target="_blank">https://une
 numerated.blogspot.ca/2017/02/money-blockchains-and-social-scalability.html
 </a>). We will explore the relationships between Blockchains\, Social Scala
 bility\, and the future of Intelligence. Peer-to-peer consensus will play a
  major role in ensuring a more peaceful\, fair\, diverse\, innovative\, and
  extropic future.<br><br>Christian is one of the co-founder at Equibit Grou
 p and designer of the Equibit protocol. Equibit is an open-source network t
 hat enables peer-to-peer issuance and exchange of crypto-securities. Wherea
 s Bitcoin provides an alternative to fiat currencies\, Equibit offers a mor
 e transparent alternative to today’s capital markets. Christian has a passi
 on for blockchains and other decentralized consensus technologies. He sees 
 P2P networks as a catalyst technology for peaceful collaboration and social
  scalability.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180627T230114Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Toronto Transhumanist Meetup
TRANSP:OPAQUE
