CREATED:20180111T023758Z
DESCRIPTION:Eventbrite: https://www.facebook.com/events/163341417644579/\nF
 acebook: https://www.facebook.com/events/163341417644579/\n\nAn introductor
 y seminar on how to protect your privacy online. \n\nTodd\, a systems admin
 istrator for a security training firm and an advocate for digital privacy\,
  will help you identify some common risks to your basic privacy\, walk you 
 through keeping your everyday communications secure\, and show you some eas
 y-to-use top-notch tools recommended by experts in the field. \n\nFrom Face
 book to iMessage\, we could be exposing private data through the software w
 e use every day and Todd will show you how it happens\, and how you can opt
 imize your devices\, both laptop and mobile\, to protect your privacy throu
 gh PowerPoint visuals and in-class practical examples.\n\nThere will a Q & 
 A after the presentation. Students are encouraged to bring laptops and mobi
 le devices for optimization\, however Todd will not be available for tech s
 upport of infected devices. \n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20180712T231518Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO\n6-1266 Queen St W\, Toronto ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Internet Privacy Basics with Todd
