DESCRIPTION:Join Alex as he takes you through the basics of the industry-st
 andard DMX protocol\, used almost exclusively to control stage lighting and
  intelligent moving lights of all kinds.  \nThe workshop starts with an int
 roduction to the protocol and how it works\, followed by a demonstration of
  software controlling several intelligent lights.  We'll finish up with a c
 lass participation moment via web-based tool that will allow the participan
 ts to work together to control a moving light.\nIf you'd like to participat
 e in the latter section\, please bring any kind of wifi-enabled internet de
 vice.  Loaners will be available.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150121T005235Z
SEQUENCE:8
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Controlling intelligent stage lights with the DMX protocol: A prime
 r.
TRANSP:OPAQUE
