DESCRIPTION:$free\nhttp://hacklab.to/archives/monday-workshops-at-hacklab/\
 n\nCome learn how to solder!  Hacklab will have a variety of kits on hand t
 o choose from for your first soldering experience (you buy the kit\, prices
  range widely but the cheapest is only $1!).  Starts at 7pm\, stay for as l
 ittle or as long as you like.  Most kits can be completed in less than an h
 our\, even by beginners.\n\nAlready know how to solder?  At this circuit ha
 cking workshop you can also get help with: surface mount soldering\, troubl
 e shooting your electronics project\, designing PCBs in eagle\, etc.  Any a
 nd all electronics hackers welcome!
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084821Z
