DESCRIPTION:Due to the success of the previous Scotch and Cheese nights\, i
 t makes\nsense to have more of them.\n\nI've scheduled one for Friday July 
 30... I'll be there with some Scotch\nand some Cheese\, and you should do t
 he same. Since Scotch and Cheese 2.0\nwas a bit of a chaotic booze-up\, I w
 ould like to keep this to Hacklab\nmembers and their close friends.\n\nBrin
 g along a bottle of Scotch or some other exciting spirit (partial\nbottles 
 OK) and some cheese or other exotic snacks\, and we'll all sample\neverythi
 ng\, discuss the results\, and listen to some good tunes.\n\nHope to see yo
 u all there. :)
