DESCRIPTION:Venus Labs has a "Future Fulfilled" document which spells out a
  100-year roadmap for how humans could colonize Venus.&nbsp\; Paul Tabashov
  and I created this document about a year ago\, and it's great\, but I feel
  like if we all work together\, we can make it WAY better.&nbsp\; In partic
 ular\, I'd love to add a LOT more detail to the near-term stuff\, really fl
 esh out the 2020s\, and make a lot more concrete the various possible engin
 eering opportunities in that time frame (cube sats\, white papers\, balloon
  experiments\, etc).<br><br>RSVP here: Wed May 9th\, 7-9pm at Hacklab:<br><
 a class="moz-txt-link-freetext" href="https://venus-labs-future-fulfilled.e
 ventbrite.ca">https://venus-labs-future-fulfilled.eventbrite.ca</a><br><br>
 And feel free to invite anyone else you think would enjoy or contribute\, V
 enus Labs needs to recruit!&nbsp\;
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083821Z
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Venus Labs Future Fulfilled
TRANSP:OPAQUE
