UID:5f3i01imnjurt0hi50daunke85@google.com
CREATED:20181113T004711Z
DESCRIPTION:Thurs Dec 13th\, 7pm in the Hacklab Classroom:\nThe Prospect of
  Immortality\nhttps://www.meetup.com/transhumanism-78/events/256522151/\n\n
 Everyone is welcome.\n\nDetails from meetup:\nDuane Hewitt will be presenti
 ng "The Prospect of Immortality: Radical life extension in advance of the S
 ingularity."\n\nWe hear about advances in biology all the time: victories i
 n the war on cancer or new treatments for degenerative diseases. However it
  seems like we have plateaued in terms of extending lifespan and healthspan
 . This presentation will be a survey of the state of the art combined with 
 my personal journey as a superlongevity enthusiast which began at a young a
 ge.\n\nDuane Hewitt has over twenty years of experience in molecular biolog
 y research and life sciences product development. Mr. Hewitt has successful
 ly contributed to many areas of biology during the course of his career inc
 luding engineering tools to manipulate antibiotic producing bacteria\, cond
 ucting high throughput screening on cancer stem cells\, engineering a unive
 rsal influenza vaccine and conducting animal studies for proof of concept a
 nd for safety for novel immunotherapeutic proteins. His research in these d
 iverse areas has resulted in both patents and papers. During the course of 
 his work he has learned to balance the importance of adding value to produc
 ts and programs while mitigating risks. Recently Mr. Hewitt worked with Tra
 nslational Life Sciences\, a neuroscience company optimizing cannabinoids f
 or unmet medical needs\, to develop nutraceutical products to sit at the in
 terface between the recreational and medical cannabis markets. Mr. Hewitt’s
  recent focus has been the supplement space where timelines to bring a prod
 uct to market are much less onerous than therapeutic drug development. Duan
 e has a lifelong passion for longevity research and chose his career as a m
 eans to achieve that end. 
LAST-MODIFIED:20181120T160008Z
LOCATION:Hacklab Classroom\, 1266 Queen St W #12\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, C
 anada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Toronto Transhumanists: The Prospect of Immortality
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
