DESCRIPTION:Announcing the first ever Hacklab Show & Tell Day!  Saturday Ma
 rch 10th\, 2012\, bring your projects to hacklab and show them off to all y
 our fellow members.  If you've been looking for a good deadline to motivate
  you to get Something Done\, this is your opportunity!  You've got over two
  months to finish it :-).  We'll meet at 2pm\, and do a round-robin show an
 d tell until we've all seen so much awesome that we have to gorge ourselves
  on pizza.
