CREATED:20141127T172428Z
DESCRIPTION:Come one come all! Artemis! The Starship bridge simulator match
 es one player per station at multiple different ships and pits them as a te
 am against invading forces who are trying to blow up your starbases! All yo
 u need is a laptop or tablet (Android or iPad) and the bravery to blow thin
 gs up with your friends! There will be several rounds and people are welcom
 e to stick around late if things are still going :)\n\nThere will be instal
 ler USB drives floating around the party for laptops\, we will be using the
  latest version. It works on all three OSs. If you bring a tablet\, you wil
 l have to purchase it on your respective app store for $2.99.\n\nThere will
  be Pizza! (pay what you can) The hacklab also has drinks available (fixed 
 price).\n\nLet's blow up some starships\, negotiate with starbases and have
  fun trying to work as a team.
LAST-MODIFIED:20141129T193030Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Artemis party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
