CREATED:20120215T000804Z
DESCRIPTION:http://hacklab-soldering7.eventbrite.com/\n\nWant to learn how 
 circuits are assembled? We'll show you how to solder\, the process of using
  a hot iron to place parts permanently unto circuit boards. Many easy to as
 semble and cool kits to choose from (see below)!\n \nKits we will have avai
 lable:\n- Stefan's hacklab blinky ($5)\n- bliplace sound reactive pendant k
 it ($10)\n- TV-be-Gone remote control kit ($20)\n- others to be chosen soon
 \n \nInstruction is free\, though donation to hacklab is encouraged\, of co
 urse!  If you have your own project or kit\, feel free to bring that instea
 d!  The instructor is knowlegable about circuit design\, layout and trouble
 shooting as well\, so bring your questions :-)
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084608Z
LOCATION:hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Soldering Workshop #7
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
