CREATED:20121127T180433Z
DESCRIPTION:Hello everybody! \n\njoin us to the next Artscisalon meeting!\n
 \nwhen: Sunday\, December 2\, 2012\, 7:30 pm\n\nwhere: Hacklab  170 A Baldw
 in Street (2nd floor)\n\nAt this Artscisalon we have  invited some of the p
 rotagonists of the Robot Hackathon (check them out at http://www.getyourbot
 on.com/) \nThe Robot Hackathon is a three-day-event taking place on Friday\
 , Saturday and Sunday (Nov. 23-25) here in Toronto. It is a unique event wh
 ere makers and aspiring builders\, coders\, hackers and other creative indi
 viduals are invited to form teams and collaborate to build bots and other s
 urprising creatures. \n\nIt sounds like  Artscisalon matter!\n\nWe will cel
 ebrate this event with Nick Stedman and some of the participants of this ev
 ent\nWe will meet at the Hacklab.to. So\, in addition to meeting our guests
 \, it will be a great occasion for the Artscisalon aficionados to check out
  a really interesting place with great people.\n\nwe will have some fun the
 med treats for you!\n\nsee you at the hacklab next sunday\n\nroberta\n\nArt
 Sci Salon http://artscisalon.wordpress.com/\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084411Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Artscisalon: Robot Hackathon!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
