 d in other people e-waste\, and walk home with new treasure!  We'll also be
  trying to figure out what hacklab should dispose of rather than move\, tho
 ugh I think we've done most of that already.\n\nI'll also be taking down Tr
 ain Overlord\, if anyone would like to help with that!
