DTSTART:20141224T190000Z
DTEND:20141225T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:vgsu39eq29hhfl13rb09g931ps@google.com
CREATED:20141219T064704Z
DESCRIPTION:Hey folks\,\n\nDon't forget that starting around 2pm on Christm
 as Eve and for most of\nthe morning/day on Christmas Day\, Hacklab will be 
 hosting Hackmas!  Come\nand eat some tasty food\, watch some Christmas movi
 es and enjoy the\ncompanionship of your fellow hacklabbers.\n\nI'll be show
 ing up 2pm-3pmish\, and baking some things\, and possibly\nmaking dinner.  
 BYOB\, and consider bringing some to share.  If you want\nto bring baked go
 ods or other food\, please do so.\n\nAnyone can propose activities\, but I 
 suggest decorating an artificial\ntree\, soldering ornaments\, watching A C
 hristmas Story\, and eating chocolate.\n\nChristmas morning I'll probably w
 hip up a batch of pancakes and/or Tofu\nScramble for anyone who happens to 
 be around.\n\nIf anyone has any questions/suggestions\, reply in this threa
 d.\n\nI'm looking forward to spending time being merry with you all \n\n--N
 icholas\nPS: For a while I was considering working on Christmas day and tol
 d\npeople that I wouldn't be at the lab on the 25th\, but I think I'd rathe
 r\nspend it at the lab.  Ignore all rumors of cancellation!
LAST-MODIFIED:20141219T064727Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.TO
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hackmas at Hacklab.TO
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
