DESCRIPTION:Announcing Hacklab Junk Independence Day 2012!  Bring all your 
 old electronics to hacklab on July 8th\, starting anytime after 1pm\, and t
 hen pick over all the stuff that other people have brought!  Take home anyt
 hing that you like.  This might be your chance to own that ancient _____ yo
 u've always coveted!  At 10am the next day (Monday)\, Shift Recycling will 
 be coming by with a truck to take everything that isn't already claimed\, f
 or e-cycling.\n\nNote: please do NOT bring old CRT screens or empty ink/ton
 er cartridges\, hacklab is too small and clean for those to be welcome.  Ot
 herwise\, the crazier the thing\, the more welcome it will be.  There will 
 be a prize for the awesomest piece of history :-)
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084204Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.TO\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Junk Independence Day!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
