CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20150224T001945Z
DESCRIPTION:Location: 1266 Queen Street West\, Unit #6\nWhen: Feb 28\, 2pm 
 until 8pm (or later if there are still lots of people around)\nHow to get i
 n: use the buzzer panel beside the door to call for entry\n\nMaybe you can'
 t make it out to the weeknight open-houses at Hacklab.to\, or maybe you jus
 t want to come and hang out with us on a Saturday.  Either way\, this comin
 g Saturday starting at 2pm we'll be hosting an open house for event.  Every
 one is welcome\, no experience required!\n\nHacklab.to is a LGBTQ-friendly 
 space.  Sadly\, we are not very physically accessible\; there are two fligh
 ts of stairs up to the main lab space and no elevator.  If you have mobilit
 y issues\, use our contact form on https://hacklab.to if you'd like to arra
 nge some assistance getting up the stairs.\n\nOptional eventbrite RSVP is h
 ere:  https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/hacklab-saturday-open-house-tickets-15884
 643396
LAST-MODIFIED:20150228T223625Z
LOCATION:6-1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Saturday Open House at Hacklab.to
