UID:vqnqobl3v10seehbq2t3i36vvk@google.com
CREATED:20160118T205128Z
DESCRIPTION:I've scheduled an e-waste pickup with Revolution Recycing for M
 onday \nFeb 22nd\, so let it be known: junk independence day at hacklab aga
 in\, \nSunday Feb 21st!  2-7pm. Bring your e-waste\, root around in other \
 npeople e-waste\, and walk home with new treasure!  On previous junk \ninde
 pendence days people have gone home with wonderful treasures like a \n1TB H
 D\, an iPod touch\, a decent desktop computer\, a classic Macintosh\, \nand
  various pieces for projects... Anyway\, come with your e-waste and \nhave 
 some fun at hacklab!\n\nhttp://www.revrecycling.com/\n\n(For those who are 
 curious about Shift Recycling\, our previous provider: \n"I should also let
  you know that back in November\, Shift Recycling sold \nthe collection arm
  of the business to Revolution. We are for the most \npart the same team an
 d business model and still offer the same great \nservice you received with
  Shift.")
LAST-MODIFIED:20160221T213531Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Junk Independence Day at Hacklab
TRANSP:OPAQUE
