UID:1t2dr9llunsookbcs9l5npuvm4@google.com
CREATED:20110219T000514Z
DESCRIPTION:$free\, RSVP link coming soon.\n\nCome learn how to solder!  Co
 urse based on Mitch Altman's <a href="http://img.skitch.com/20100219-pmcq2a
 uhgiwj1imwd2p8rg8sju.jpg">Soldering is Easy!</a>.  <a href="http://twitter.
 com/hypatiadotca">Leigh Honeywell</a> will be teaching.  There will be a va
 riety of kits to choose from\, so you'll have something to learn on and tak
 e home at the end of the night:\n\n- <a href="http://www.tanjent.com/doku.p
 hp?id=bliplace">bliplace</a> sound reactive pendant kit ($10)\n- <a href="h
 ttp://www.makershed.com/ProductDetails.asp?ProductCode=MKCE4">Trippy RGB Wa
 ve</a> kit\, responds to movement ($10)\n- <a href="https://www.tvbgone.com
 /cfe_tvbg_buy.tvbgkit.php">TV-be-Gone</a> remote control kit ($20)\n- <a hr
 ef="http://www.makershed.com/ProductDetails.asp?ProductCode=MKSM1">Truth Ki
 t</a> galvanic skin response bracelet ($50)\n- <a href="http://sensebridge.
 net/projects/northpaw/">North Paw</a> compass anklet kit ($149)\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083647Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Soldering Workshop for Women 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
