DESCRIPTION:Embark on a journey of scientific exploration at our upcoming D
 IYBio meetup! Whether you're reconnecting with old friends or stepping into
  our community for the first time\, meet fellow enthusiasts in a vibrant at
 mosphere where curiosity knows no bounds. Dive into exciting projects\, fos
 ter new connections\, and fuel your passion for biotechnology. Let's come t
 ogether\, learn\, collaborate\, and shape the future of DIY biology!<br><a 
 href="https://www.meetup.com/diybio-toronto/events/296830402">https://www.m
 eetup.com/diybio-toronto/events/296830402</a>
LAST-MODIFIED:20231019T202105Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:DIYBio Meetup: Uniting Innovators\, Igniting Ideas!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
