CREATED:20150305T015837Z
DESCRIPTION:I've scheduled an e-waste pickup with Revolution Recycing for M
 onday \nMarch 23rd\, so let it be known: junk independence day at hacklab a
 gain\, \nSunday March 22nd!  2-7pm. Bring your e-waste\, root around in oth
 er \npeople e-waste\, and walk home with new treasure!  On previous junk \n
 independence days people have gone home with wonderful treasures like a \n1
 TB HD\, an iPod touch\, a decent desktop computer\, a classic Macintosh\, \
 nand various pieces for projects... Anyway\, come with your e-waste and \nh
 ave some fun at hacklab!\n\nhttp://www.revrecycling.com/\n\n(For those who 
 are curious about Shift Recycling\, our previous provider: \n"I should also
  let you know that back in November\, Shift Recycling sold \nthe collection
  arm of the business to Revolution. We are for the most \npart the same tea
 m and business model and still offer the same great \nservice you received 
 with Shift.")
LAST-MODIFIED:20150322T164139Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Junk Independence Day at Hacklab
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
