 s Workshop!  All levels welcome\, from complete beginner to seasoned arduin
 o user\, there is always more to learn.  We'll help each other out!  If eno
 ugh beginners show there may also be a guided lesson similar to the last wo
 rkshop for total beginners.  If only a few\, Eric will individually help th
 ose people get started.  Instruction is free and open to the public\, no RS
 VP is required.
