CREATED:20121004T164131Z
DESCRIPTION:Hear Ye!  Hear Ye!  Hacklab will be having a members night on W
 ednesday October 17th starting at 7:00!  There will be free pizza!\n\nCome 
 and hang with your fellow members\, and discuss the future of hacklab.  Pau
 l and I toured the space above Cobbs Bread (right next door) today\, and th
 is meeting will be our chance to discuss moving there.  Paul will be postin
 g photos and a layout to the wiki soon.\n\nAlso\, if you have something tha
 t you'd like to discuss with all the members\, I've made a stub page on the
  wiki for this meeting:\n\nhttp://wiki.hacklab.to/Meeting-2012-10-17\n\nHop
 e to see you all there! 
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084653Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Members Meeting
TRANSP:OPAQUE
