CREATED:20151026T205334Z
DESCRIPTION:Hacklab.TO will be hosting the launch party for Toronto Studio 
 Commons\, a new group which aims to bring together the various artist studi
 os and spaces across the city.  We're launching with 13 studios\, and the l
 aunch party will be at Hacklab!\n\nWhat: Toronto Studio Commons Launch Part
 y\nWhen: Friday Nov 20th\, 8-11pm\nWhere: Hacklab.TO\, 1266 Queen Street We
 st\nWhy: the various spaces will each have members here\, talking about wha
 t they do\, so you can come and learn about all these cool places!\n\nhttp:
 //torontostudiocommons.com/members/\n\nThe launch party also kicks off a we
 ekend "studio crawl" of open houses\, workshops and events\, you can check 
 out all the spaces over the course of the weekend and end with a tea party:
 \nhttp://torontostudiocommons.com/studio-crawl-2015/
LAST-MODIFIED:20151121T003800Z
LOCATION:HackerYou\, 3rd floor\, 483 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2A9\, Ca
 nada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Toronto Studio Commons Launch Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
