DESCRIPTION:A one-day workshop on extremely elaborate stamp-making\, using 
 laser cut illustration board. \n\nLab fees $10/each to cover supplies if yo
 u want to participate and take home a plate and some lovely business cards.
 \n\nI'll be providing a How To sheet\, printed\, along with access to mater
 ials and supplies.\n\nThis will be a busy and crowded workshop even if it's
  just me hangin' out printing a hosquillion copies of one image. Come hang 
 out and find out how it's done.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083725Z
LOCATION:hacklab
SEQUENCE:0
