CREATED:20080925T160725Z
DESCRIPTION:Incorporation Party!\n\nCome join us at the HackLab to celebrat
 e our non-profit incorporation\, get ready for Nuit Blanche and SecTor\, or
  even check out the space if you haven't seen it already.\n\nYes\, yes\, it
 's not a secret\, we're also fundraising-- help us out as we try to offset 
 our start-up costs.\n\nAlso\, we have a couch now\, for real.
