DESCRIPTION:Free and open to the public.\n\nHacklab will be having a t-shir
 t hacking workshop on Monday October 24th\, 7-9pm.  We'll be working with t
 -shirts and doing things like:\n\n - laser cutting them\, ala http://www.di
 anaeng.com/\n - boxy to foxy\, like this:\nhttp://www.instructables.com/id/
 T-Shirt-Mod-Boxy-to-Foxy/\n - stylishly cut up your t-shirt\, like this:\nh
 ttp://www.instructables.com/id/Cut-Up-the-Back-of-your-T-Shirt-Simple-DIY-T
 utor/\nhttp://www.instructables.com/id/The-T-Shirt-Hack-Or-How-to-revamp-an
 -old-t-shirt/\n\nOr any other t-shirt hack\, if you're keen and you find so
 me instructions\, let's try it out!  Bring your old t-shirts and let's make
  them fresh again!\n
