UID:6m9d345ie3mrjojtku4ufoo0gk@google.com
CREATED:20130704T145935Z
DESCRIPTION:http://hacklabsoldering11.eventbrite.com/\n\nWant to learn how 
 circuits are assembled? We'll show you how to solder\, the process of using
  a hot iron to place parts permanently unto circuit boards. Many easy to as
 semble and cool kits to choose from (see below)!\n\nKits we will have avail
 able:\n- Stefan's hacklab blinky ($5)\n- TV-be-Gone remote control kit ($20
 )\n- Diyode Codeshield (requires arduino) ($20)\n- Game of Life Kit v1.3 ($
 20)\n- Drawdio ($20)\n- Minty Boost ($20\, bring your own altoids mint tin)
 \n\n \nInstruction is free\, though donation to hacklab is encouraged\, of 
 course!  If you have your own project or kit\, feel free to bring that inst
 ead!  The instructor is knowlegable about circuit design\, layout and troub
 leshooting as well\, so bring your questions :-)
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083807Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.TO\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Soldering Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20231022T150000Z
DTEND:20231022T190000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:50hv1bk02onflmimq6o8t38idd@google.com
CREATED:20230928T004904Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>Bring a laptop along to just chill out with others\, brin
 g a fiber project\, or just bring your curiosity and questions. We're excit
 ed to meet you!</span><br><br>This open house is different from our every T
 uesday event. The women of Hacklab are hosting this for members of the publ
 ic\, and specifically women who are interested in learning about makerspace
 s. We’re specifically excited about folks who want to learn about who we ar
 e and what we do\, who have projects they have made or are working on that 
 they want to show and tell\, who want to ask for help with making something
  awesome\, or who want to help out on other folks’ projects.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230928T175356Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto\, ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HackLab Women's Open House
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
