DESCRIPTION:For full details\, including the address\, and to RSVP see:\nht
 tp://www.meetup.com/quantifiedself-toronto/events/24650361/\nQuantified Sel
 f Toronto\nLet's meet and share our recent tracking!  It's been awhile sinc
 e the last meetup\, sorry for the long delay.  Eric attended the Quantified
  Self Conference back in May\, and he'll report on that.  Otherwise it will
  be the typical show & tell - bring stories of your tracking\, or just come
  to watch.  A computer and projector will be available if you have slides /
  data to present.  
