DESCRIPTION:A group for trans women and cis women\, as well as non-binary p
 ersons who want to focus on women's experiences. Open to members of these g
 roups who are also members of makerspaces\, especially in Ontario\, and mor
 e specifically Toronto.\n\nSeptember 27\, 2023 - Initial meeting is for pla
 nning objectives and desires of the membership. Come help us define the gro
 up and what we want from makerspaces as women.
