DESCRIPTION:The Civic Tech TO "Accelerator Project" will be holding a meeti
 ng to tackle these goals: https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mkqhRTzws4Bde
 yWO65cgA5rN_iQhCpi5k0H8rHVoo1M/edit\n\nThe Accelerator Project is an attemp
 t to study and tackle youth homelessness. We review papers and studies\, an
 d we conduct primary research by going to shelters and teaching folks how t
 o code with Processing.js.
