CREATED:20111017T203847Z
DESCRIPTION:$free\, RSVP here:\nhttp://hacklabto-soldering.eventbrite.com/\
 n\nLearn how to Solder. For total beginners\, or those with some experience
 . Learn how to solder\, which is one method of assembling an electronic cir
 cuit. Instruction by Eric is free\, and we’ll have a variety of interesting
  kits on hand for you to purchase as learning templates. You’ll take your k
 it home at the end of the night\, working\, guaranteed! \n\nKits we will ha
 ve available:\n- Stefan's hacklab blinky ($5)\n- bliplace sound reactive pe
 ndant kit ($10)\n- Trippy RGB Wave kit\, responds to movement ($10)\n- TV-b
 e-Gone remote control kit ($20)\n- North Paw compass anklet kit ($140)
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084349Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Soldering Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
