DESCRIPTION:Hacklab is running two Lockpicking workshops on July 5\, the fi
 rst running from 2pm until 4pm and the second running from 5pm until 7pm.  
 This event is open to all ages and all interested parties.  Free signup at 
 EventBrite is mandatory — there are only 5 spots available at each workshop
 .  \n\nThis event is Pay-What-You-Can\, with a suggested donation of $10 or
  more to help us keep the lights on.  Nobody will be turned away for lack o
 f funds.\n\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/learn-lockpicking-at-hacklabto-tick
 ets-15659731679
