DESCRIPTION:The Research With Impact Series presents Hacking Back: The Batt
 le for Human Rights Online\, with Ronald J. Deibert\, Department of Politic
 al Science and Director\, The Citizen Lab\, Munk Centre for International S
 tudies\, University of Toronto.\n\nAn exposé of the colonization and milita
 rization of the Internet through censorship\, surveillance and information 
 warfare\, and the efforts of one group of "hacktivists" at the University o
 f Toronto to develop tools that empower global citizens and protect their r
 ights to freely share and access information online.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084304Z
LOCATION:Innis Town Hall\, Innis College\, 2 Sussex Avenue\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacking Back: The Battle For Human Rights Online
TRANSP:OPAQUE
