CREATED:20160818T152701Z
DESCRIPTION:This is an event for T.O. Mesh\, where we'll be flashing Raspbe
 rry Pi's\, installing CJDNS and getting some mesh nodes up and running.  If
  you haven't already confirmed that we can provide the hardware for you\, p
 lease feel free to show up anyway\, but bring your own hardware.  \n\nPleas
 e bring a laptop for flashing the MicroSD cards\, as well as SSH'ing into t
 he pi for setup.  The lab has one or two loaner laptops which people can us
 e\, but they're old and clunky.\n\nRequired hardware:\nRaspberry Pi 3 Model
  B\nA 16gb or larger MicroSD card\nWall-plug USB charger/adapter capable of
  minimum 2.5 amps\nA TP-Link TL-WN722N Wireless dongle (This is a specific 
 model and substitutions can't be made)\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160821T192714Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:T.O. Mesh node-building workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
