CREATED:20180116T135110Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.meetup.com/quantifiedself-toronto/events/246851512/
 \n\nCalling all those interesting in health. With so much data and tools av
 ailable to us\, are we able to accurately measure our health?\n\nTopics mig
 ht include:\n\n- How do you stay on track with (and track) health\, diet an
 d fitness?\n- What kinds of tools / tests / biomarkers are useful for measu
 ring health and aging?\n- What kinds of supplements are people taking for h
 ealth/aging reasons?\n- What's the latest science on drugs/biomarkers?\n- C
 an we create a standardized testing protocol for quantifying health? Depend
 ing on the number of people who attend\, we might split off into breakout g
 roups for discussion and then report back. We'll be launching a small group
  for dedicated trackers who will work together to quantify and improve thei
 r health over the coming years. If that sounds interesting to you\, you sho
 uld come!\n\nAll types are people are welcome! We value inclusivity and div
 ersity\, and we want to hear your voice.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180130T160419Z
LOCATION:1266 Queen Street West #6\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Quantified Health
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
