UID:36f9a95lfqpl5ghecbc1ki8csb@google.com
CREATED:20180514T202044Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.meetup.com/Bio-hacking-Longevity-Group-Toronto/even
 ts/251317089/\n\nThanks again to all who came out to the last event and mad
 e it a success. Great discussion and feedback - I know I walked away having
  learned something new !\n\nAs promised at the last event\, our next meet-u
 p will be on the topic of life and healthspan extension\, covering the scie
 nce and the business sides of the industry. Over 100 companies are working 
 on solutions in this field\, which has been identified as the hottest place
  to invest by a number of notable investors. Some questions to think about:
 \n\n- Will the science of ageing catch up with the aspiration of ultra-long
  lives?\n- What are the aging biomarkers ?\n- Will we see viable anti-aging
  solutions in our lifetime ?\n\nNote: I just got back from a trip overseas 
 where I had a chance to meet with Brian Kennedy in Singapore and get his th
 oughts on the field of longevity - which I will definitely share as well.\n
 \n• What we’ll do:\n\nThis will be an interactive and thought-provoking pre
 sentation\, lead by me + discussion\, with the purpose of unpacking the ant
 i-aging and longevity industry.\n\nIf you’ve ever been curious about health
  and lifespan extension – this meet-up will be the perfect opportunity to d
 elve in\, learn\, ask questions\, and discuss !\n\n• What to bring:\n\nYour
  enthusiasm and curiosity !\n\n• Important to note:\n\nIf you would like to
  bring a guest\, please have them register for this meet-up\, so that I hav
 e a better idea of the attendees and numbers\, as there is limited space at
  the venue.\n\nLooking forward to seeing you there !\n\nP.S. If you'd like 
 more background/context before the meet-up\, check out my compiled list of 
 top 10 talks on longevity: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/want-live-younger
 -longer-10-must-see-talks-human-andreiuk-mbiotech/
LAST-MODIFIED:20180621T001622Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Bio-hacking and Longevity Meetup
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
