DESCRIPTION:Pi Day is nearly upon us\, and no celebration plans have yet be
 en made.  I hereby propose that we meet at the hacklab on Sunday\, March 14
 \, from 5pm onward\, for a celebration of pi(e).  Create your best pie\, br
 ing whatever beverages you desire\, and let’s have a good time!\n\nhttp://h
 acklab.to/archives/pi-day-party/
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083833Z
LOCATION:HackLabTo
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Pi Day Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
