CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20160122T150134Z
DESCRIPTION:SPECIAL SATURDAY OPEN HOUSE: Hacklab opens up our front door to
  members of the public. We’re specifically excited about folks who want to 
 show off projects they have made or are working on\, want to ask for help w
 ith making something awesome\, or want to help out on other folks’ projects
 . Bringing a laptop along to just chill out with other geeks is also welcom
 e.\n\nThere’s no minimal skill level required to participate\, and we do ou
 r best to be a respectful\, friendly environment for everyone. Regretfully 
 we are not wheelchair accessible – there are steps leading up to the floor 
 the lab is on. As a heads-up to folks with sensory processing issues\, the 
 Tuesdays can get quite busy and noisy. 7 to 9 pm tends to be the busiest ti
 me\, but in our new larger space there are usually places you can get away 
 from it.\n\nMembers of the media are also welcome\, but in the interest of 
 member privacy we have cute little press passes hanging by the door\, and r
 equire that permission be sought before taking photos with people in them.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160130T191930Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HackLab.TO Open House
TRANSP:OPAQUE
