CREATED:20140411T165647Z
DESCRIPTION:Don’t remember much from high school biology? What you do remem
 ber seems light-years behind where biology is today? \n\nJoin us as we go t
 hrough Albert’s Molecular Biology of the Cell textbook. \n\nInspired by the
  BioCurious study group for the same\, we're going to be working through th
 e book\, working together to improve our knowledge of biology!\n\nEvery mon
 th\, we read one chapter and discuss it at the meetup\, this month it's Cha
 pter 15: Mechanisms of Cell Communication.  We also pick a recent scientifi
 c article to talk about\, and have a general wide-ranging discussion of mol
 ecular biology / synthetic biology / DIYbio in the news.  Article TBD.
LAST-MODIFIED:20170103T191529Z
LOCATION:Ten Forward Lounge @ hacklab.to\, 1266 Queen Street West
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:DIYbio Study Group at hacklab.to: Chapter 15
TRANSP:OPAQUE
