UID:3da9hlceiss47qcetdit4rc9mv@google.com
CREATED:20180807T164532Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><br>Hi HackLab! We are having our bylaw-mandatory Annual Ge
 neral Meeting on 8th November 2018 at 7pm!<br><br>For newer members know wh
 at this is about: We all get together quarterly to talk about things that a
 re going on in the lab\, plan what's coming up\, and deal with any issues t
 hat we've been wanting to talk about in real life. It's encouraged but not 
 required that you attend\, and there's pizza for all!<br><br>The agenda is 
 up at &lt\;<a href="https://wiki.hacklab.to/Meeting-2018-11-08-AGM">https:/
 /wiki.hacklab.to/Meeting-2018-11-08-AGM</a>&gt\; and you can add anything y
 ou want to bring up under the "Discussion Items" heading. You can also view
  agendas from past meetings at &lt\;<a href="https://wiki.hacklab.to/Meetin
 gs">https://wiki.hacklab.to/Meetings</a><br>&gt\; to see the kind of things
  that go on at them.<br><br>If you can't make the meeting\, please enter yo
 ur proxy here: &lt\;<a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfBcW
 TquDHwyyVmHS3wJuR0P6cULH6q1Hy2DK1Ro24RDU16dg/viewform?usp=sf_link">https://
 docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfBcWTquDHwyyVmHS3wJuR0P6cULH6q1Hy2DK1Ro24
 RDU16dg/viewform?usp=sf_link</a><br>&gt\;. If you feel uncomfortable fill i
 n the Google Form you can email me the board your proxy to &lt\;<a href="ma
 ilto:board@hacklab.to">board@hacklab.to</a>&gt\;.
LAST-MODIFIED:20181108T233510Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HackLab.TO AGM
TRANSP:OPAQUE
