UID:jdr54herj7ihc6pernjm5cunhg@google.com
CREATED:20130208T200147Z
DESCRIPTION:I have a 100W thermopile sensor on order\, and when it arrives 
 [likely in 2 weeks] I plan to perform some characterization  and maintenanc
 e on the laser. My goal is to determine how much laser power we really are 
 getting through the system to see if we need to get a recharge for the tube
 . While I'm at it\, I'll also be inspecting the optics\, and cleaning anyth
 ing that needs cleaning. I also plan to inspect the exhaust and seal any cr
 acks/holes I find. This maintenance will likely happen on a Tuesday evening
 \, as that is really the only time I have available. So tentatively the las
 er will be off-line on the 19th\, unless there are any objections.\n\nCheer
 s\,\nMark
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084415Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Laser Maintenance: Laser Cutter Offline
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
