CREATED:20100716T132407Z
DESCRIPTION:Andrew Kilpatrick will be presenting a workshop on how to use L
 EDs properly! He's going to cover how to properly read an LED datasheet\, c
 alculate parameters for your circuit\, and how to properly drive high power
 \, super-bright LEDs.\n\nA lot of Hacklabbers use LEDs in their circuits\, 
 this is a chance to learn the theory and the techniques to maximize efficie
 ncy and brightness without blowing up your LED.\n\nNon-members are welcome\
 , but a cash donation to the lab would be appreciated.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084808Z
LOCATION:Hacklab!
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:LED Workshop w/Andrew Kilpatrick
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
