 ch.com/20100219-pmcq2auhgiwj1imwd2p8rg8sju.jpg">Soldering is Easy!</a>.  Th
 ere will be a variety of kits to choose from\, so you'll have something to 
 learn on and take home at the end of the night:\n\n- <a href="http://www.ta
 njent.com/doku.php?id=bliplace">bliplace</a> sound reactive pendant kit ($1
 0)\n- <a href="http://www.makershed.com/ProductDetails.asp?ProductCode=MKCE
 4">Trippy RGB Wave</a> kit\, responds to movement ($10)\n- <a href="https:/
 /www.tvbgone.com/cfe_tvbg_buy.tvbgkit.php">TV-be-Gone</a> remote control ki
 t ($20)\n- <a href="http://www.makershed.com/ProductDetails.asp?ProductCode
 =MKSM1">Truth Kit</a> galvanic skin response bracelet ($50)\n- <a href="htt
 p://sensebridge.net/projects/northpaw/">North Paw</a> compass anklet kit ($
 149)\n\n
