DESCRIPTION:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/familiar-a-tarot-readers-study-grou
 p-tickets-41775610977\nTarot Card Study Group at Hacklab\nPotential topics 
 will likely cover symbology\, mysticism\, numerology\, astrology\, Kabbalah
 \, Jungian psychology and any of the many layers of meaning infused into th
 e cards. Cost of event is free\, but donations are encouraged.  Others are 
 invited to attend and share their insights. Together we will learn the mean
 ings of all 78 cards of the traditional tarot. This is expected to be a tig
 hter knit group of open minded\, or like minded individuals.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180118T002322Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tarot Card Study Group with Sonia
