UID:1tgcp1kebbm2lvcaicq6p1crak@google.com
CREATED:20170210T011204Z
DESCRIPTION:Hi Guys! \n\nWould it be possible to have the delegation visit 
 between 1:00pm -1:30pm on Wednesday February 15th?\n\nI’m happy to answer a
 ny questions\, but for quick context:\n\n-5 delegates from China’s associat
 ion for science and technology\n-they started “AST Space” a maker/DIYbio sp
 ace in Hangzhou and are beginning to grow the community (it would be great 
 for you to share how Hacklab has grown\, struggles\, etc.)\n-the leader of 
 this group\, Bing\, is super awesome\, and genuinely wants to get more peop
 le “making” in China.\n\nThanks!\nJustin.\n\nDr. Justin Pahara\nLead Scient
 ist\n\n---\n\nBing Zhu\nDeputy Director of International Department / Zheji
 ang Association for Science and Technology\n\nYun Zhang\nVice President / J
 iaxing Association for Science and Technology\n\nFuzhou Shu\nVice president
  / Taizhou Association for Science and Technology \n\nYaying Lin\nSecretary
  General / Zhoushan Association for Science and Technology\n\nJianfu Zhou\n
 President / Tongxiang Association for Science and Technology\n\nYongping Yu
 \nDirector of Science Popularization Department/ Hangzhou Association for S
 cience and Technology\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20170215T180634Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Zhejiang AST Space - Tour of Hacklab/DIYbio
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR;ACKNOWLEDGED=20170215T180634Z:AUTOMATIC
