DESCRIPTION:Hacklab.to & GTALUG Present:\nSeatbelts and Airbags for Bash w/
  Michael Potter\n\nThis presentation will focus on the underutilized featur
 es of bash that are critical to building production quality scripts. Demos 
 will show you how to turn on options and error trapping that expose the hid
 den time bombs in the code.\n\nRSVP to attend at:\nhttps://www.eventbrite.c
 a/e/seatbelts-and-airbags-for-bash-tickets-51177497272
LAST-MODIFIED:20181009T040003Z
