DESCRIPTION:$free\nhttp://hacklab.to/archives/monday-workshops-at-hacklab/\
 nhttp://arduino.cc/\n\nLearn how to use Arduino\, the super-easy microcontr
 oller platform created for artists.  All the yaks are pre-shaved\, you can 
 make a light blink in the first minute of the workshop!  Open to all levels
 \, total beginners welcome\, more knowledgeable people can come and ask que
 stions or get help.  Stay for as little or as long as you like.\n\nPlease b
 ring your arduino and a laptop.  If you don't yet have an arduino\, Creatro
 n is nearby\, just leave 30 minutes early at head over to:\n\n255 College S
 t. (just east of Spadina)\nhttp://creatroninc.com/\n\nSee you at the worksh
 op!
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084723Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Canada
