CREATED:20160118T221454Z
DESCRIPTION:http://hacklabhackaday2.eventbrite.ca\n\nHacklab.TO and Hackada
 y are hosting a Bring A Hack meetup on April 20th 2016! Doors 7pm\, talks s
 tart 8pm.  Party till late.\n\nWe’ll have drinks\, snacks\, hacks and swag.
  It’s a Bring A Hack style meetup\, where you bring the project you’re work
 ing on and show it off to enthusiastic supporters.\n\nThere will also be li
 ghtning talks\, which are short talks about projects or ideas you’re workin
 g on.\n\nSophi from Hackaday will be in town to talk about the Hackaday Pri
 ze\, the engineering competition with $300\,000 in cash prizes (you read th
 at correctly!).  http://hackaday.io/prize\n\nWant to get on the talks list?
  Let us know! (contact sophikravitz@hackaday.com)\nNOTE: as with last year\
 , we expect overwhelming demand.  Seats will go fast\, grab them while you 
 can.  Then we've got some standing room only in the back/side of the room. 
  If you're really interested in checking out hacklab\, we also offer an Ope
 n House every Tuesday 6pm till late\, so feel free to drop by.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160420T223007Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Hackaday Bring your Hack 2
TRANSP:OPAQUE
