DESCRIPTION:REGISTER HERE: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/the-snacklab-tickets
 -21039597001\n\nYou are here to learn the subtle science and exact art of f
 ood preparation. As there is little foolish wand waving or silly incantatio
 ns here\, many of you will not believe this is real magic. I don’t expect y
 ou will really understand the beauty of the softly simmering Bolognese with
  its shimmering fumes\, the delicate power of spices that seep through Bana
 nas Foster\, bewitching the mind\, ensnaring the senses…I can teach you how
  to sauté fame\, stew glory\, and put a stuffing in death – if you aren’t a
 s big a bunch of dunderheads as I usually have to teach.\n\nSorry. Couldn’t
  resist.\n\nWe’ll be together for the next four weeks. In this course\, we’
 ll come together to help you learn basic and intermediate knife skills\, te
 mperature control\, tips and tricks of timing\, and to develop your palates
 \, as well as a number of other topics described in the schedule\, below.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160621T031504Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:The SnackLab!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
