CREATED:20160423T162523Z
DESCRIPTION:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/cirque-it-social-registration-24610
 182719\nhttp://cirque-it.com/\n\nCirque-It is back with another sensational
  season where the world of wearable-tech makers/developers\, fashion design
 ers and performers collide. BOOM. As a kick-off\, we are excited to introdu
 ce our (first of three) Cirque-It: Social events\, before our annual flagsh
 ip show in September.\n----\n6 p.m.\, Wed.\, May 11 @ HackLab.TO (1266 Quee
 n St. West Suite #6)\n----\nSo\, whether your interests are in fashion\, we
 arables\, or performance\, come meet with like minded individuals to chat a
 nd entertain even the possibility of combining forces.\nPreserve Indulgence
 \, will also be there\, selling dishes of classic and modern cuisine fusion
 .\nBe sure to join our Facebook Event Page. \n\nThis is a 19+ alcohol-frien
 dly event. Limited space\, RSVP early!\n\nCirque-It and its satellite event
 s are produced by Noble Sky.
