  it with a little electricity\, and see if we can make LIFE!  Agenda:\n\n1)
  Talk about biocurious and DIY biology and what we'd like to accomplish (br
 ain storming)\n\n2) See our own DNA!  http://www.pbs.org/wgbh/nova/teachers
 /activities/pdf/2809_genome_01.pdf\n\n3) Make HUGE todo list :-)\n\n4) Gene
 rally have an awesome time\, of course!
