DESCRIPTION:Haskell is a very different programming language than most: it 
 is functional\, pure\, lazy\, and strongly typed with inference. It's the t
 arget of lots of programming language research\, with crazy new features be
 ing released every couple of months. It's users generally swear by it.\n\nI
 t's also a language with a very intimidating reputation. \n\nIn this worksh
 op\, we will go over a lot of the basics of Haskell and hopefully capture s
 ome of the motivations behind it.
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083829Z
LOCATION:Hacklab
SEQUENCE:2
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Haskell
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
