DESCRIPTION:free and open to the public\nhttp://www.meetup.com/quantifiedse
 lf-toronto/\n\nQuantified Self is about people doing self-experimentation. 
  Are you logging data about your health or your life?  Are you using smart 
 phones or computers to track your behavior?  Want to share and learn from p
 eople doing the same kinds of things?  Quantified Self is for you.  All mee
 tings are informal show & tell sessions.  You don't have to share if you do
 n't want to - but sharing is a great way to get awesome feedback and really
  get your motivation going.  
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083823Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Toronto Quantified Self Show & Tell #4
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20150725T220000Z
DTEND:20150726T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:hlm66lthcub3gig0g4pfjkn2f0@google.com
CREATED:20150613T225500Z
DESCRIPTION:$10\nhttps://www.eventbrite.ca/e/hacklabto-7th-birthday-party-b
 bq-and-project-show-tell-tickets-17176565570\n\nSaturday July 25th\, 6pm ti
 ll late.  Hacklab's 7th Birthday Party BBQ with Project Show & Tell.  In an
 ticipation of Maker Festival\, we'll be putting finishing touches on our pr
 ojects and showing them off\, plus helping anyone who need assistance with 
 theirs!\nEverybody is welcome\, you do not have to be a member or ever have
  been to hacklab before.  $10 suggested donation at the door\, or you can p
 ay in advance with eventbrite (right here!).  All proceed support hacklab i
 n our ongoing 7-year mission to pay rent\, explore new strange new (tech) w
 orlds\, and make lights blink. Tours given\, questions answered\, come see 
 our space and meet interesting people!\nBBQ food and sodas available 6-8pm.
   We'll be supplying burgers and hot dogs and soda\, but if you'd like some
 thing else\, bring what you'd like!  BYOB alcohol.\nProject show & tell at 
 9pm\, send an email to president at hacklab.to if you'd like to reserve a s
 pot - all spots 5 minutes in duration\, we do have a projector & sound syst
 em if you need it.  You do not have to be a member to present.\nNeed help? 
  Come work on your maker festival projects at hacklab\, use our equipment\,
  get assistance from our knowledgeable members.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20150725T213026Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab 7th Birthday Party
TRANSP:OPAQUE
