CREATED:20120716T191748Z
DESCRIPTION:http://hacklab-git.eventbrite.com/\n\nIntroduction to GIT\, the
  distributed source control management application developed by Linus Torva
 lds\, for use with the linux kernel.  Useful for a variety of things other 
 than code (e.g. writing\, admin\, personal wiki's).  Also taught: github.co
 m\, an online service for managing private and public git repositories.  Wo
 rkshop will be taught by Fumon.  Members only until we determine the level 
 of demand.  Please RSVP on the eventbrite.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083737Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Git & Github Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20150511T230000Z
DTEND:20150512T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:a6b9te07dfn5fhepsk47fljo70@google.com
CREATED:20150428T042417Z
DESCRIPTION:http://www.meetup.com/DIYbio-Toronto/events/222150391/\n\nRecen
 tly some Chinese scientists published a paper talking about genetic enginee
 ring of human zygotes (fertilized egg cells): CRISPR/Cas9-mediated gene edi
 ting in human tripronuclear zygotes.  You can read the entire paper online 
 at that link.  Unsurprisingly\, this got a big news reaction here in north 
 america\, check it out: arstechnica\, hplusmagazine\, io9\, business inside
 r\, nature\, etc.\n\nLet's talk about it.  Issues we can discuss include:\n
 \n - technical details of the actual thing which was done\n\n - discussion 
 about WHO did it\, what the scientists want\, the institutions that support
  them\, and why.  Compare the Chinese situation to that in the USA and the 
 UK.  \n\n - discussion of the ethics of human genetic engineering\, as comp
 ared to for instance couples choosing their mates\, or things like China's 
 one-child policy\, or eugenics.\n\n - wide-ranging discussion of the future
  of humans and genetic engineering.
LAST-MODIFIED:20150510T174407Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:let's talk about human genetic engineering
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
