DESCRIPTION:MOP Days are a chance for members to come in and collaborate on
  lab related efforts. Instead of struggling to coordinate with someone elec
 tronically or on busy open houses a MOP Day is a great chance to come in an
 d get some work done. \n\nBring in something you've been wanting to work on
 \, connect with other members\, or pitch in on the lab backlog.  MOP Days a
 re also a great time to plan events\, workshops\, and outreach. There are a
 lready many ongoing projects that could use a helping hand. It’s also a cha
 nce to bring up any lab related questions or concerns you’ve wanted some he
 lp with.  However\, remember this is members helping members. So come on ou
 t and let's work together to get things going!
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T070528Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:MOP Days (Member + Ops)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
