DESCRIPTION:Weekly Applied Rationality Meetup (LessWrong MeetUp)\n\nThe top
 ic is mind hacks: any little tricks we use (or have heard about) to steer o
 ur minds in the direction we want them to go.\n\nExamples:\n- Mental contra
 sting\n- Schelling fences\n- Mnemonic techniques\n- any other techniques pe
 ople find useful and want to share \n\nWhere: Hacklab - Treehouse or Classr
 oom (depending on group size)\nOpen to all\n\nwww.LessWrong.com\nhttp://www
 .meetup.com/Less-Wrong-Toronto
LAST-MODIFIED:20150312T223012Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Applied Rationality LessWrong Meetup: Mind Hacks
