DESCRIPTION:If you are new to programming or you want to know more about Ru
 by or both\, you should join us in this introductory workshop.\n \nWe are g
 oing to see some important concepts of programming\, then we are going to a
 pply those concepts with Ruby.\nPlease install the follwing package in your
  Mac\, Windows or Linux machine:\nhttp://railsinstaller.org/\n \nThen\, ple
 ase install the following text editor:\nhttp://www.sublimetext.com/2\n \nYo
 u have to install these two software before the workshop. If you've already
  installed them before\, you are fine.\n \nIf you want to read and get read
 y for the workshop\, you can read this text: \nhttp://www.troubleshooters.c
 om/codecorn/ruby/basictutorial.htm\n \nThanks for your interest.\n \nAs usu
 al\, all workshops at Hacklab.to are provided for free to the community.\n\
 nPlease register at: http://introruby.eventbrite.com/
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T083651Z
LOCATION:Hacklab
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Introduction to Programming with Ruby
TRANSP:OPAQUE
