 r bylaws) on Wednesday April 27\, from 7-9pm.  There will be free pizza as 
 always. \n\nAgenda here:\nhttps://wiki.hacklab.to/Meeting-2016-04-27-AGM\n\
 nSen is prepping some kind of bylaw update package\, which will do things l
 ike change our "headquarters" address from 170A Baldwin to our current plac
 e... shouldn't be controversial\, but we will need to find 2/3 of all membe
 rs to vote\, which typically means a LOT of proxies.  You'll hear us making
  noise about that later.\n\nFeel free to add anything else you'd like to di
 scuss to the meeting agenda.  I've added to entries about hacklab potential
 ly paying for new equipment and cleaners...
