DESCRIPTION:Come learn how to use OpenSCAD\, the programmers solid 3D CAD m
 odeler.\n\nhttp://www.openscad.org/\n\nIt's a programming language for crea
 ting CAD models\, and it can be used to generate the STL files that e.g. th
 e MakerBot 3D printer requires.  It's commonly used when people are collabo
 rating on the design of a 3D object over the internet\, because proprietary
  CAD programs (like SolidWorks) are expensive and don't run on linux... Add
 itionally\, if you're used to programming\, it's a super powerful way of cr
 eating complicated objects (you can iterate\, define variables\, make libra
 ries to quickly automate common tasks\, etc)
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084132Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab: OpenSCAD Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
