DESCRIPTION:    *  Week #1 - Wednesday\, April 15\, 2009 - Introduction\, p
 resentation and handing out of electronic parts kits.\n    * Homework - Rea
 d article\, get familiar with the parts\, gather some of your own tools.\n 
    * Week #2 - Wednesday\, April 22\, 2009 - Build your power supply.\n    
 * Homework - Finish your power supply.\n    * Week #3 - Wednesday\, April 2
 9\, 2009 - Check out your power supply. Start building pitch oscillators.\n
     * Homework - Finish your pitch oscillators.\n    * Week #4 - Wednesday\
 , May 6\, 2009 - Check out your pitch oscillators. Start building antenna b
 oards and antennas.\n    * Homework - Finish your antenna boards and antenn
 as and try building the volume oscillator.\n    * Week #5 - Wednesday\, May
  13\, 2009 - Check out your pitch circuit and see if we can make some sound
 s!\n    * Homework - Finish your VCA circuit. Start assembling control pane
 l wiring.\n    * Week #6 - Wednesday\, May 20\, 2009 - Final circuit testin
 g. Start assembling the enclosures.\n    * Homework - Final Tweaks.\n    * 
 Week #7 - Wednesday\, May 27\, 2009 - Final troubleshooting and assembly. T
 une up and rock out! \n\nThis workshop is full\, but there will be another 
 one soon!  If you want on the list for the next one\, check out http://hack
 lab.to/archives/build-a-theremin-hacklab/ for Andrew's infoz
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084056Z
SEQUENCE:6
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:theremin workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
