DESCRIPTION:Twitter Bootstrap Workshop is a tutorial session of how to use\
 , implement and customize the Twitter framework to your web 2.0 projects.\n
 \nThis frameworks allows your web projects to look great with minimum of ef
 fort and it has nifty features that enhance your app's user experience.\n\n
 We will be creating a layout for a web app that helps people to search for 
 bachelor apartments in the city of Toronto using Twitter Bootstrap.\n\nhttp
 ://www.eventbrite.com/event/4423197904
