UID:rb34klerhb6upgv0ni9pfpcudo@google.com
CREATED:20111006T173340Z
DESCRIPTION:Come visit hacklab every other Sunday\, 3pm onwards as we reviv
 e the “gamfternoon” gaming sessions of hacklab lore. There will be a copy o
 f Settlers of Catan and Dominion on hand\, or bring your games to share wit
 h others for the afternoon. The more the merrier\, invite all your friends!
  Non-members totally welcome\, the door will be unlocked. We’ll probably re
 peat gaming sessions on a regular basis\, though dates and times may change
 .
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084649Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Gamfternoon
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20110919T230000Z
DTEND:20110920T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:thsouej4rm1ues0kkhm4duhvr4@google.com
CREATED:20110824T194034Z
DESCRIPTION:Want to learn how circuits are assembled?  I'll show you how to
  solder\, the process of using a hot iron to place parts permanently unto c
 ircuit boards.  Many easy to assemble and cool kits to choose from (see bel
 ow)!\n\nDue to the limited amount of desk space and soldering irons at Hack
 lab\, and the awesome number of people who have sent me an email about the 
 workshops\, I have decided that we need to take RSVPs for the soldering wor
 kshops.   Please RSVP here: <a href="http://hacklab-soldering.eventbrite.co
 m/">http://hacklab-soldering.eventbrite.com/</a>.  Currently RSVPs are limi
 ted to 10 people\, that's realistically all we have the space & irons for h
 ere at hacklab.\n\nKits we will have available:\n\n- Stefan's hacklab blink
 y badge ($3)\n- <a href="http://www.tanjent.com/doku.php?id=bliplace">blipl
 ace</a> sound reactive pendant kit ($10)\n- <a href="http://www.makershed.c
 om/ProductDetails.asp?ProductCode=MKCE4">Trippy RGB Wave</a> kit\, responds
  to movement ($10)\n- <a href="https://www.tvbgone.com/cfe_tvbg_buy.tvbgkit
 .php">TV-be-Gone</a> remote control kit ($20)\n- <a href="http://sensebridg
 e.net/projects/northpaw/">North Paw</a> compass anklet kit ($149)\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20221122T084744Z
LOCATION:Hacklab.to\, 170A Baldwin Street\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hacklab Learn how to Solder Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
