DESCRIPTION:Lawrence will be ordering some food and talking all things Came
 ra. \n\nHomework: Bring 1-3 cool photos you took in 2023\, cellphone camera
  or JWST are fine\, whatever you have!\n\nAlso\, feel free to bring whateve
 r gear you shoot with/want to shoot with. \n\nI have some plans for fun act
 ivities we can do (show and tells\, lunch and learns\, photoshoots/photowal
 ks) eventually with the hope of getting some film and darkroom stuff back u
 p and running.
LAST-MODIFIED:20240110T072159Z
SEQUENCE:0
