BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:HackLab.TO
DTSTART:20181028T010000Z
DTEND:20181028T060000Z
DTSTAMP:20260512T040225Z
UID:7B850E46-1A84-4334-9061-D2CE9FF3D483
CREATED:20180929T012711Z
DESCRIPTION:Eventbrite: https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/hackoween-2018-tickets-
 50801266957\nFacebook event page: https://www.facebook.com/events/214349751
 9015524/\n\nCelebrate both Hallowe'en and Hacklab's milestone 10th year in 
 style at our Hack'o'ween Fundraiser! We'll have DJs and dancing\, a raffle 
 with awesome prizes provided by our members including 1-on-1 lessons and me
 ntoring in a wide range of areas\, Hacklab t-shirts\, collectables and more
 ! Spooky weird science is everywhere! \n\nHacklab is the longest-running ma
 kerspace in Toronto. Started from humble beginnings as a place for techies 
 to build and play with equipment as well as controlling it with software pr
 ogramming in a Kensington bunker\, Hacklab has grown to include a DIYBio an
 d chemistry lab\, sewing corner\, VR lab and more. \n\nCome help us celebra
 te and raise funds to ensure the doors stay open and we continue to share a
 nd help members and non-members alike make their dream projects come to lif
 e!\n\nSnacks\, non-alcoholic beverages and fluorescent mocktails will be av
 ailable however this is a BYOB event.\n\n**no ticket refunds 7 days run up 
 to the event\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20181028T010643Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO\n6-1266 Queen St W\, Toronto ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Hack'o'Ween Party!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
