 ng in just over a month\, on Wednesday May 29th\, from 7-9pm.  There will b
 e free pizza!  Plus socializing with all your hacklab friends.  If you've g
 ot something you'd like to talk about at the meeting\, please add it to the
  agenda:\n\n[link]\n\nCurrently we'll have:\n - update on moving\, includin
 g indiegogo fund raising\, etc.\n - remaining changes to anti-harassment po
 licy\n - 
