DESCRIPTION:I propose we have a show & tell on Monday April 29th\, 7-9pm.  
 There isn't a workshop that night currently so it's available.  Members and
  non-members welcome!  We'll do it fairly informally\, so if you've got som
 ething to show & tell\, just bring it the night of\, and figure on getting 
 a few minutes to explain your project (this means *five* minutes max).  Loo
 king forward to seeing what everyone is up to!\n
