CREATED:20130918T114927Z
DESCRIPTION:Every Tuesday\, from around 6pm until late\, the lab opens up o
 ur front door to members of the public. We’re specifically excited about fo
 lks who want to show off projects they have made or are working on\, want t
 o ask for help with making something awesome\, or want to help out on other
  folks’ projects. Bringing a laptop along to just chill out with other geek
 s is also welcome.\n\nThere’s no minimal skill level required to participat
 e\, and we do our best to be a respectful\, friendly environment for everyo
 ne. Regretfully we are not wheelchair accessible – there are steps leading 
 up to the floor the lab is on. As a heads-up to folks with sensory processi
 ng issues\, the Tuesdays can get quite busy and noisy. 7 to 9 pm tends to b
 e the busiest time\, but in our new larger space there are usually places y
 ou can get away from it.\n\nMembers of the media are also welcome\, but in 
 the interest of member privacy we have cute little press passes hanging by 
 the door\, and require that permission be sought before taking photos with 
 people in them.
LAST-MODIFIED:20171019T153009Z
LOCATION:1266 Queen Street West Suite #6\, Toronto
SEQUENCE:13
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:HackLab.TO Open House
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-APPLE-TRAVEL-ADVISORY-BEHAVIOR:AUTOMATIC
