DESCRIPTION:Tarot Card Study Group at Hacklab\nPotential topics will likely
  cover symbology\, mysticism\, numerology\, astrology\, Kabbalah\, Jungian 
 psychology and any of the many layers of meaning infused into the cards. Co
 st of event is free\, but donations are encouraged.  Others are invited to 
 attend and share their insights.  Together we will learn the meanings of al
 l 78 cards of the traditional tarot. This is expected to be a tighter knit 
 group of open minded\, or like minded individuals.
LAST-MODIFIED:20180516T225503Z
LOCATION:Hacklab\, 1266 Queen St W\, Toronto\, ON M6K 1L3\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Tarot Card Study Group at Hacklab with Sonia
TRANSP:OPAQUE
