UID:avab928oa8olblhjojfj0qguck@google.com
CREATED:20231101T032541Z
DESCRIPTION:MOP Days are a chance for members to come in and collaborate on
  lab related efforts. Instead of struggling to coordinate with someone elec
 tronically or on busy open houses a MOP Day is a great chance to come in an
 d get some work done. <br><br>Bring in something you've been wanting to wor
 k on\, connect with other members\, or pitch in on the lab backlog.  MOP Da
 ys are also a great time to plan events\, workshops\, and outreach. There a
 re already many ongoing projects that could use a helping hand. It’s also a
  chance to bring up any lab related questions or concerns you’ve wanted som
 e help with.  However\, remember this is members helping members. So come o
 n out and let's work together to get things going!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260327T035742Z
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:MOP Days (Member + Ops)
TRANSP:OPAQUE
