DESCRIPTION:CANCELLED! CANCELLED! CANCELLED! Contact info@hacklab.to for de
 tails\n\nOpen House evenings are opportunities for the public to come meet\
 , get to know\, and join \nour community. We provide tours of the space\, l
 imited use of the equipment (liability waiver required)\, and a great socia
 l atmosphere. \nIf you have project you're working\, feel encouraged to bri
 ng it\, hang out\, and maybe get help with what you're working on. Members 
 are happy to answer questions as available. 
