CREATED:20260419T140840Z
DESCRIPTION:E-waste does not belong in the landfill. Help Hacklab in its mi
 ssion to make you independent from your junk and pick up a few new gadgets\
 , gizmos and obsessions along the way!\nJunk Independence Day is an event w
 here people come together to swap and recycle old electronics including:\nC
 omputers\, laptops and parts\nPrinters\nStereo amps\, speakers\nStreetlight
 s\nTablets\nCalculators\nHobby electronics supplies\nHouse Rules:\nAll item
 s on our central table are fair game. If you are not willing to part with s
 omething\, do not put it on the table.\nItems brought in for the Junk Indep
 endence Day are not to be disassembled on site. If you want only part of an
  item\, take it home\, and bring the rest back next junk day.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260419T140928Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO\n1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Junk Independence Day
TRANSP:OPAQUE
