DESCRIPTION:\nAmpleLabs.co is a not-for-profit team of technologists and de
 signers who make tools to empower individuals experiencing homelessness. Th
 ey meetup every sunday to check in on each other and work on stuff!\n\nRigh
 t now their working on at chat bot that makes referrals to vital services (
 ChalmersBot.AmpleLabs.co). \n\n\nFeel free to join in!\n\nJoin with Google 
 Hangouts: https://hangouts.google.com/hangouts/_/calendar/M29vNnM3MDlndTdkM
 zFjZzE0MTljZnJidWNAZ3JvdXAuY2FsZW5kYXIuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbQ.6rk8c94jt2njitejro2l8
 g8hq9?hs=121
