CREATED:20260406T162455Z
DESCRIPTION:Improv is improvisational comedy! You might have seen it on Who
 se Line Is It Anyways\, but it's basically making up a comedy scene or show
  without a script! If you'd like to learn the basics\, just want to watch\,
  or want to get some extra practice in\, come to this Improv Jam! Hosted by
  award winning Improviser and performer\, Tyler Mann @bigrattheatre \, this
  2 hour event is 'pay-what-you-can' and anybody of any skill level can part
 icipate!
LAST-MODIFIED:20260506T152150Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO\n1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Improv Jam
TRANSP:OPAQUE
