DESCRIPTION:Open House evenings are opportunities for the public to come me
 et\, get to know\, and join our community. We provide tours of the space\, 
 limited use of the equipment (liability waiver required)\, and a great soci
 al atmosphere. If you have a project you're working on\, feel encouraged to
  bring it\, hang out\, and maybe get help with what you're working on. Memb
 ers are happy to answer questions as available. 
