CREATED:20260506T152439Z
DESCRIPTION:Costumed Life Drawing hosted by Zee the Raccoon\n\nPWYC ($10 su
 ggested)\n\n3 Hours - 20 min break at the halfway point for snacks/socializ
 ing.\n\nWant to brush up on your life drawing skills with an anthropomorphi
 c twist? Hacklab.TO is providing space for us to host a life drawing sessio
 n for furries & the people who want to draw them. Space is very limited - s
 ign up using the QR code/Google form ASAP to hold your spot!\n\nIf you have
  a fursuit and would like to model\, please note this on the form. Models m
 ust be over 18 and capable of staying still for sessions of 5 minutes. Mode
 ls are not compensated monetarily\, but some artists have gifted the artwor
 k created of them in the past.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260506T163450Z
LOCATION:HackLab.TO\n1677 St Clair Ave W\, Toronto ON M6N 1H9\, Canada
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Draw Furries IRL!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
