DESCRIPTION:Open House evenings are opportunities for the public to come me
 et\, get to know\, and join <br>our community. We provide tours of the spac
 e\, limited use of the equipment (liability waiver required)\, and a great 
 social atmosphere. <br>If you have project you're working\, feel encouraged
  to bring it\, hang out\, and maybe get help with what you're working on. M
 embers are happy to answer questions as available. 
