 t. Come hang out with the Hacklab server team. Watch as we work through the
  process of maintaining and update Hacklab's computers and servers. Or co-w
 ork along\, and get advice on maintaining your own systems.\n\nThe goals of
  this session is knowledge sharing\, and improving our documentation about 
 Hacklab's services.
